 "headline": "Da Don's Pickups Bury theInfamous Early",
 "notes": [
  "White Mambas have Bam Adebayo at 24-15-12 and Jamal Murray at 26 points, and Giddey's 14 assists are just rubbing it in on LeParth James.",
  "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw just snatched FG% from theInfamous, whose Kevin Huerter is 1-for-8 and personally lighting the shooting percentage on fire.",
  "Suggs to be you stole AST from Gopher Gold, though Andre Drummond has a line so empty the box score just left a blank space.",
  "theInfamous started Huerter's 1-8 brick parade while Khaman Maluach, benched, banked 9 points and 5 boards, and the bench is quietly costing them FG%, OREB and DREB.",
  "White Mambas ripped 3PTM from LeParth James, and John Collins has four threes tonight, a nightly reminder to LeParth that he is a cat behind."
 ],
