 "week_copy": {
  "headline": "Da Don's Pickups Are Wrecking theInfamous",
  "subhead": "Saddiq Bey and Daniss Jenkins flipped a 4-6 loss into a 7-2 romp, and theInfamous has the receipts in the form of Devin Vassell.",
  "zingers": [
   {
    "team": "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw",
    "line": "Saddiq Bey and Daniss Jenkins turned a 4-6 loss into a 7-2 beating, and Ausar Thompson's 18 and 12 tonight is gravy."
